#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of btrfs-progs"
msgstr "Instalação do btrfs-progs"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>btrfs-progs</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>btrfs-progs</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:142
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-static        \\\n"
"            --disable-documentation &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --disable-static        \\\n"
"            --disable-documentation &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Some tests require grep built with perl regular expressions. To obtain this,"
" rebuild grep with the LFS Chapter 8 instructions after installing <xref "
"linkend=\"pcre2\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Alguns testes exigem grep construído com expressões regulares perl. Para "
"obter isso, reconstrua o grep com as instruções do Capítulo 8 do LFS depois "
"de instalar o <xref linkend=\"pcre2\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Before running tests, build a support program:"
msgstr "Antes de executar os testes, construa um aplicativo de suporte:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:160
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make fssum</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make fssum</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue (as the &root; user):"
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita (como o(a) usuário(a) &root;):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:166
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd tests\n"
"   ./fsck-tests.sh\n"
"   ./mkfs-tests.sh\n"
"   ./cli-tests.sh\n"
"   ./convert-tests.sh\n"
"   ./misc-tests.sh\n"
"   ./fuzz-tests.sh\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd tests\n"
"   ./fsck-tests.sh\n"
"   ./mkfs-tests.sh\n"
"   ./cli-tests.sh\n"
"   ./convert-tests.sh\n"
"   ./misc-tests.sh\n"
"   ./fuzz-tests.sh\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If the above mentioned kernel options are not enabled, some tests fail, and "
"prevent all the remaining tests from running because the test disk image is "
"not cleanly unmounted."
msgstr ""
"Se as opções do núcleo mencionadas acima não estiverem habilitadas, alguns "
"testes falharão e impedirão todos os testes restantes de executarem, porque "
"a imagem de teste do disco não foi desmontada corretamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:203
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package as the &root; user:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:206
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have passed <parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter> to "
"<command>configure</command> and you need the manual pages, install them by "
"running, as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver passado <parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter> para "
"<command>configure</command> e precisar das páginas de manual, instale-as "
"executando, como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:214
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for i in 5 8; do\n"
"   install Documentation/*.$i /usr/share/man/man$i\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for i in 5 8; do\n"
"   install Documentation/*.$i /usr/share/man/man$i\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/btrfs-progs.xml:227
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter>: This switch disables "
"rebuilding the manual pages, because it requires <xref linkend=\"sphinx\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-documentation</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"reconstruir as páginas de manual, porque isso exige <xref "
"linkend=\"sphinx\"/>."

